  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/656/656-3.htm",
  "statuteText": "656:3 Preparation. –\n\nAt least 6 days before any state general election is to be held, the official state general election ballot shall be sent by the secretary of state to the city and town clerks."
